g viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" stroke-width="2.6"><path d="m6 12.5 4 4 8-9"/></svg></span><span class="suit-item__text">Want recurring income from cartridge changes and servicing</span></div></li><li><div class="suit-item"><span class="suit-item__check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" stroke-width="2.6"><path d="m6 12.5 4 4 8-9"/></svg></span><span class="suit-item__text">Value a brand that competes on quality and service, not the cheapest price</span></div></li></ul></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-shell dealer-existing dealer-image-layout"><div class="dealer-section-photo"><img src="<?php echo $baseUrl; ?>/assets/images/adding-pureLine-img.webp" alt="Adding PureLine to an existing trade business" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="dealer-section-copy"><h2>Adding PureLine to an existing trade business</h2><p>If you already run a plumbing business, whole house filtration fits neatly into work you&#039;re doing anyway. You&#039;re already on site for hot water replacements, renovations and new builds, and you already have the licence to install. Offering a filter at those moments is a natural conversation, not a cold sell.</p>
